% Lyrics in a voice other than the first one, in a tune with a P: play
% order (GitHub issue #85).  At each part, writetrack() (genmidi.c) went
% to the V: field of the voice without starting its line of music there,
% so that it reported a "Line of music without lyrics" and wrote none of
% the lyrics of this voice.  In part B, voice K has a line of rests
% without lyrics in tune 1, as in the issue, and notes with lyrics in
% tune 2.
X:1
T:Lyrics in parts
C:abc2midi test
V:S clef=treble
V:K clef=treble
P:AB
M:C
L:1/4
K:C
P:A
[V:S] C E G c |]
w:    C E G c
[V:K] C E G c |]
w:    C E G c
P:B
[V:S] C E G c |]
w:    C E G c
[V:K] z z z z |]

X:2
T:Lyrics in parts, both voices
C:abc2midi test
V:S clef=treble
V:K clef=treble
P:AB
M:C
L:1/4
K:C
P:A
[V:S] C E G c |]
w:    C E G c
[V:K] C E G c |]
w:    C E G c
P:B
[V:S] C E G c |]
w:    C E G c
[V:K] D F A d |]
w:    x y z w
